OL,3,GNEWSAWinning Gardeners' World contest
OL,4,A'overwhelming'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe winner of a BBC Gardeners' World
OL,7,FMagazine competition to find the best
OL,8,Foverall garden has described winning
OL,9,Fthe award with her allotment as
OL,10,F"completely overwhelming".
OL,12,FNadine Mitschunas, 47, was crowned the
OL,13,Fwinner of the publication's 10th
OL,14,Fanniversary edition of its Gardens of
OL,15,Fthe Year contest for her allotment in
OL,16,FWallingford, Oxfordshire.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,339,330,200,160,0,100
