OL,3,GNEWSAWinning Gardeners' World contest
OL,4,A'overwhelming'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I thought I didn't really have a
OL,7,Fchance, because I don't even have a
OL,8,Fproper garden," she told the BBC. "I
OL,9,Fdon't have a garden at home, so I
OL,10,Factually made my allotment into my
OL,11,Fgarden."
OL,13,FKevin Smith, the magazine's editorial
OL,14,Fdirector, said: "To put this much
OL,15,Fpassion and hard work into a shared
OL,16,Fspace says everything, with wildlife at
OL,17,Fthe very heart of it."
